Subject: [PATCH -next V11 6/7] riscv: entry: Consolidate ret_from_kernel_thread into ret_from_fork
Date: Sat, 10 Dec 2022 12:11:40 -0500
Message-Id: <20221210171141.1120123-7-guoren@kernel.org>
